## Agent context (token controls)

- **Headroom + graphify** — compress logs/diffs; use `/graphify query` for structure instead of full-file reads (`agent-token-scope` rule).
- **Scoped edits** — one file/test per turn; diff review before accept (`incremental-agent-edits` rule).
- **Locators** — snapshot/MCP ground truth in `pageObjects/**` only (`locator-verification` rule).
